### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "murilo",
  "senha": "123"
}

### Listar posts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts

### Criar post (substitua TOKEN por token de professor)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materia": "Matematica",
  "assunto": "Exemplo de assunto",
  "descricao": "Conteudo do post",
  "habilitado": 1,
  "autor": "Professor"
}

### Listar professores (p) ou alunos (a)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users?tipo=p&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Cadastrar usuário
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "novo_usuario",
  "email": "novo@example.com",
  "tipo": "a",
  "senha": "senha123"
}
